{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00865","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高 · 张循之","name":"鼓吹曲辞 巫山高","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巫山高不极，沓沓状奇新。\n暗谷疑风雨，幽岩若鬼神。\n月明三峡曙，潮满二江春。\n爲问阳台夕，应知入梦人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张循之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}